      <revisionDesc>
         <change isodate="2026-10-11" resp="#resp.editor">
            <changeDesc>
               <p>Edition header: MEI 5.1 CMN declarations, responsibility, edition, source and work metadata, editorial declaration and this revision history. It replaces the metadata written by Verovio's Humdrum import and the study's project note. The page head in the score (pgHead) now shows the printed head instead of the import's composer line and life dates.</p>
            </changeDesc>
         </change>
         <change isodate="2026-10-11" resp="#resp.editor">
            <changeDesc>
               <p>Validation repairs (commit 54e2992): the pickup is bar 0 with metcon="false"; the one-note beam in bars 2–3 became a cross-staff beamSpan with the printed downward stem; the grace note in bar 3 has its printed natural (the Kern encoding had a flat).</p>
            </changeDesc>
         </change>
         <change isodate="2026-10-11" resp="#resp.editor">
            <changeDesc>
               <p>Converted from MEI 6.0-dev to MEI 5.1 by scripts/migrate_mei51.py (commit 9572be9): the repeat structure became one expansion in printed order (I A A B B); three hidden rests became mSpace.</p>
            </changeDesc>
         </change>
         <change isodate="2026-09-27" resp="#resp.editor">
            <changeDesc>
               <p>Study (CAMAT PDF-facsimile workflow): converted the Kern encoding with Verovio, gave all IDs the movement prefix and linked each bar to its zone on the UE page images. Provenance: provenance/ in the repository.</p>
            </changeDesc>
         </change>
      </revisionDesc>
   </meiHead>
